WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.230
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.618
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:16.300
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.012
Resume complete.

00:00:18.012 --> 00:00:23.470
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:28.634
Read-only replay.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.867
Back live. Paused.
